<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>India News | Latest India News Today &amp; Real-time News from India, India Breaking News</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india</link><description>India News Today: Get latest India news and breaking news from India on Times of India. TOI brings the top news headlines from India on Politics, Elections, Current Affairs and more</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-11-07T15:08:42+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/-2128936835.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Sat, 07 Nov 2026 15:08:42 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>India News | Latest India News Today &amp; Real-time News from India, India Breaking News</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india</link></image><item><title><![CDATA['More you connect with locals, weaker enemy’s plots become': Rajnath Singh's message to troops in WB's Bagdogra]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/more-you-connect-with-locals-weaker-enemys-plots-become-rajnath-singhs-message-to-troops-in-wbs-bagdogra/articleshow/135632296.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135632296.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Defence minister Rajnath Singh addressed soldiers in Bagdogra, urging them to connect with local residents for security. He highlighted that strong connections could weaken enemy plots in sensitive border regions. Singh emphasized the significance of discipline and courage for every soldier in the armed forces. He stated that high morale among soldiers is essential for achieving victories, even with limited resources.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/more-you-connect-with-locals-weaker-enemys-plots-become-rajnath-singhs-message-to-troops-in-wbs-bagdogra/articleshow/135632296.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/more-you-connect-with-locals-weaker-enemys-plots-become-rajnath-singhs-message-to-troops-in-wbs-bagdogra/articleshow/135632296.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-07T14:55:09+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aastha Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135632451,imgsize-200346.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Let Modi, Rahul question each other': Kapil Sibal wants 'historic' debate on SIR]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/let-modi-rahul-question-each-other-kapil-sibal-wants-historic-debate-on-sir/articleshow/135632129.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135632129.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/let-modi-rahul-question-each-other-kapil-sibal-wants-historic-debate-on-sir/articleshow/135632129.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/let-modi-rahul-question-each-other-kapil-sibal-wants-historic-debate-on-sir/articleshow/135632129.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-07T14:48:44+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aadrita Halder</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135632243,imgsize-131024.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Not supported by tests': Petroleum ministry rejects over 20% ethanol blending in Karnataka]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/not-supported-by-tests-petroleum-ministry-rejects-over-20-ethanol-blending-in-k